gy  and they'll likely continue to use it as  a payment technology as well eventually  i think that the regulators are going to  understand that they're making a misstep  they'll come around and they'll go ahead  and actually encourage people not only  to invest not only to saving these  technologies but also use it as a medium  of exchange as well hey you did you like  this video great we make five of them a  day and post them here on this channel  make sure you subscribe like the video  and see you next time
 

